  "provenance": "The Mailpit website source at 8d2c4706bb30744fac8cc58f72ce6e65e496aba9 (https://github.com/axllent/mailpit-website/tree/8d2c4706bb30744fac8cc58f72ce6e65e496aba9/content/docs) is an unversioned documentation snapshot from the release date of Mailpit 1.33.0. The article bodies are extracted from the publisher's Hugo v0.169.0 build after shortcode expansion. The complete REST API operation descriptions and schema are formatted from the OpenAPI 2.0 artifact shipped at the exact 1.33.0 release commit 364916b15e80a8bac1e7b0ab66a4f2b3d7d745c2 (https://github.com/axllent/mailpit/blob/364916b15e80a8bac1e7b0ab66a4f2b3d7d745c2/server/ui/api/v1/swagger.json). The static API keeps the upstream Swagger operation anchors, and an older link to the dedicated send API authentication section targets its current heading.",
